# round B90 (w249): the multiplicative pair term h_i * (1 + gamma(c)) added beside the additive context, one block. The perturbation OPERATOR ladder on the inductive incumbent w190 (GO, HiGHS pFBA, MOMA; 0.217 over twelve seeds). On a single deletion the plain cross-attention has one key, so its context is a linear map of the deleted gene with no dependence on the querying gene (the model's null-sink comment, verified there); these arms give the operator depth and the two pair terms. INDUCTIVE. Paired against w190 by seed. Six seeds at 36 GB.
